N        EQU   16
INPUT    EQU   1000
COUNT    EQU   1100
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  N           C1. Clear COUNTs.
         STZ   COUNT,1     COUNT[i] ← 0.
         DEC1  1
         J1P   *-2         N ≥ i > 0.
         ENT1  N           C2. Loop on i.
         JMP   1F
2H       LDA   INPUT,1
         LDX   COUNT,1
3H       CMPA  INPUT,2     C4. Compare Ki : Kj.
         JGE   4F          Jump if Ki ≥ Kj.
         LD3   COUNT,2     COUNT[j]
         INC3  1             +1
         ST3   COUNT,2       → COUNT[j].
         JMP   5F
4H       INCX  1           COUNT[i] ← COUNT[i] + 1.
5H       DEC2  1           C3. Loop on j.
         J2P   3B
         STX   COUNT,1
         DEC1  1
1H       ENT2  -1,1        N ≥ i > j > 0.
         J2P   2B
         HLT
         END   START
